,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_6","text":"it helps to know where they came from.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_7","text":"From what do you think the Queen originated?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_8","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_8","text":"A human.","jump":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_11","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_9","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_9","text":"A Nikke.","jump":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_15","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_10","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_10","text":"The universe.","jump":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_16","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_11","text":"Your arrogance is staggering.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_12","text":"However, you're not completely off base.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_13","text":"The Queen started out as a Nikke.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_14","text":"And as we all know, the main building block for a Nikke is the human brain.","jump":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_19","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_15","text":"Very perceptive.","jump":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_19","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_16","text":"Eh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_17","text":"This is all getting a little too metaphysical for me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_18","text":"The answer was a Nikke.","jump":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_19","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_19","text":"Me. Liberalio. Indivilia. Anachiro. \nPlenty more that you don't know about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_20","text":"And the Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_21","text":"We all started out as corrupted Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_22","text":"Through a special process, of which no one understands the inner workings, we were reborn.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_23","text":"Each of us transformed into the ideal figure we envisioned in our minds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_24","text":"My lust for combat gave me this form.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_25","text":"Liberalio, meanwhile, longs for tranquility, and thus assumed the form of a deep-sea creature.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"DeepWater","bgArt":"deepwater","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["liberalio"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_26","text":"As for the Queen...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_27","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Volcano_04","bgArt":"volcano_04","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["nihilister","rapi","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_28","text":"She was filled with... how should I put it... a maternal instinct?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_29","text":"Even though using that word sounds like a sick, twisted joke to me now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_30","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_32","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_32","text":"Rapi and Anis exchange a look of consternation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_33","text":"That process sounds eerily familiar to ordinary Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_34","text":"Using the brain of a human female, a body which most closely resembles her vision is constructed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_35","text":"That body is manufactured using an enigmatic process that defies any human understanding.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_36","text":"Now you're telling us that Heretics are made in the same way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_37","text":"What does it all mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_38","text":"Wait, hold up. Don't think about this too much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_39","text":"It doesn't matter if Raptures copied human technology, or the other way around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_40","text":"Either way, we know what needs to be done, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_41","text":"... So,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_42","text":"what does any of this origin stuff have to do with us making the Queen go night-night?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_43","text":"Think carefully.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_44","text":"All of us, all living things,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_45","text":"are inexorably compelled to know more about where we came from.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_46","text":"But unlike me and all the others, the Queen's body was not consumed entirely during the processing stage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_47","text":"Her body is the only one that remains somewhere on the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_48","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_49","text":"Perhaps you have heard of Lilith's body?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_50","text":"The Queen's predecessor and the only thing she neglected to take care of during her time on the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_51","t