"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_58","text":"This object, Lilith's body, is the key to killing her. It's the only way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_59","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_60","text":"Well? How does it work?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_61","text":"Spill the beans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_62","text":"Sorry, I just can't seem to recall.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_63","text":"You'll have to let your own imagination fill in the blanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_64","text":"You know...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_65","text":"There are two foolproof ways to rankle someone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_66","text":"One is to not finish what you're saying, and the second is...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_67","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_67","text":"Are you not planning on telling us what we actually need to know?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_68","text":"What can I say? I have my moments of capriciousness.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_69","text":"I'm sure I'll be in a better mood in, let's say... 3 days. Perhaps I'll tell you the rest then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_70","text":"Your ploy won't work. You're just buying time in order to recover.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_71","text":"You're one to talk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_72","text":"You're the ones who intentionally came here to finish me off when I was vulnerable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_73","text":"My only recourse is wielding the information I have.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_74","text":"Why would I relinquish it so easily?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_75","text":"... Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_76","text":"There's no guarantee that she'll stay true to her word when the time comes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_77","text":"If she manages to recover fully, we may have lost our only chance to finish her off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_78","text":"I recommend not making any rash negotiations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_79","text":"Give me a break.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_80","text":"Why are you making this so complicated?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_81","text":"Your choices are: A. Kill me, one of several of the Queen's vanguards, or B. Kill the Queen herself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_82","text":"It's not that difficult to see which is the better decision.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_83","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nihilister_02_83","text":"You have a point. However.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nihilister_02_84",